{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在秘密測試一款面向Windows 11的新型人工智能應用，其內部代號為「Project Pantheon」。與此前曾引發廣泛討論的Recall功能不同，這款新工具不會自動記錄用户屏幕上的所有活動，而是僅保存用户主動選擇的內容，因此被外界視為一種更加注重私隱的新型「記憶系統」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583440.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T19:39:49.638279+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T19:29:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T19:37:54.687870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T19:37:54.687870+00:00","content_hash":"17f9ae457bdb1cbf75f797e081ae416e2f084f3b7292e41088b8be200fbdbeb0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}